            "text": "Command Injection\n\nThe `execute` function uses `msg.data` directly, making it vulnerable to Command Injection attacks.\n\nImpact: An attacker could inject malicious commands and potentially take control of the contract.\n\nRemediation: Use parameterized commands and validate user input"
